Package: librga-dev
Version: @VERSION@
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Maintainer: rk-builder maintainers <whoarei@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libstdc++6
Homepage: https://github.com/airockchip/librga
Description: Rockchip RGA userspace library and development files
 RGA is a 2D hardware accelerator available on Rockchip SoCs. This package
 contains the official aarch64 shared library and API headers published by
 airockchip/librga.
